      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FROZEN WINTER (4) started big odds in tougher last time when finishing 4th over 300m at this track. Was a this track winner in lesser company the start prior. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from five attempts. Looks the one to beat on her best form. PERIODICAL (1) has a strong record this journey here with four wins and a minor from seven starts. Comes off a (19.37) win last time, scoring by 1.3 lengths in a Mix 3/4 over 350m at this track. Suited here and expected to run well. ALOFT (8) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, hitting the line hard to place two back then came home strongly into third (16.88) in a Grade 5 at this track last time. Solid record here at the distance winning six races. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Deserves a win and gets his chance. NALA'S GIRL (7) looks a top-three hope after a break.",
